ency and confidence in clinical settings.\n\nVS-Management has been reviewed by medical experts and developed in accordance with the latest medical education standards, ensuring a reliable and effective learning environment. \n\nThis VR simulator offers an immersive experience for mastering ventilator procedures and alarm management.", "short_description": "VS-Management is a VR-based ventilator simulator designed for users to train ventilator operation and learn three key alarm management procedures."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "015.VS_M_Back.png", "id": "1690717328178195", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473394271_1690717331511528_6387639417886293840_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=AS9XC_D9NscQ7kNvwFfeeDb&_nc_oc=Adq4_ULzc-KvDq_ikkxR0lpsYS-bdd20dUFP4KfX-JCNljr5prYg33w0VxUe36TSFnY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af03MmJ7iYmj1Mbmb7QVBmLtGodWaAv7Boc8cEfioEMRTg&oe=69F4AB39"}, {"file_name": "014.VS_M.png", "id": "1624805861475462", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473394167_1624805864808795_4742067852837435819_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=z53Z4p1z49oQ7kNvwFXyi5M&_nc_oc=Adoc6uM6qKwHggtdMTanMi6kOQ21zv6y88Py1QJJkzGdTlW9BtYGlccbApOp0dFRdNk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af3aqtQs15-DnGEJlWw9jQSvy_W4CT0GDKvj-AVsO4S85A&oe=69F4998F"}, {"file_name": "006.VS_M_Portrait.png", "id": "1192361138888724", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473400716_1192361142222057_7581507312873433284_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8HJifS2fjDQQ7kNvwESk35r&_nc_oc=AdqikqTjVfDjOQMAf3pvi5db__Fj4NkMfrFNj-gIpNFASTPa3o87-ry6wUAh5azkrwg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af1kuEVCMpnEJ4DcORtyeZuXxtmiyD1XT5GZdhCp9e5zhA&oe=69F4A76E"}, {"file_name": "005.VS_M_Squa